The little bunny hopped through the meadow while the warm sun slowly disappeared behind the distant hills.
A bunny's day is not about hopping as fast as possible but about finding the sweetest strawberries along the way.
A strawberry is simply a delicious little fruit, and sometimes that is all the happiness you really need.
In the beginning there was nothing, which exploded into an entire field of strawberries.
The bunny does not care about your deadlines, your complicated plans, or how many carrots you have in your basket.
Sometimes the simplest solution is also the sweetest one, and sometimes you spend three hours looking for a strawberry that was right behind you.
